(
    title: "Care Bears",
    description: Some("Only a graphics demo survives: two Care Bears drifting over clouds, one patrolling on its own while the player slides the other back and forth. The finished design would have had you catching Tummy Symbols from bears descending the screen and arranging them in sequence against a timer — programmer Laura Nikolich called it nearly finished before Parker Brothers\' marketing cancelled it, judging the children\'s market shrinking and the play too tame."),
